From: Androlinzberg maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Host RenderThread: restore pinned vsync and callback scheduling

Follow renderthread/RenderThread.cpp's initializeChoreographer, frameCallback,
threadLoop and callback registration/dispatch verbatim. The host variant is
still needed for the GBM/Ganesh context seam instead of Android EglManager and
VulkanManager. Empty host frame methods lose retries and render-thread animations
when CanvasContext defers a frame. Reuse native Choreographer/DisplayManager JNI
and SF timing, retaining callback deduplication, cancellation and phase ordering.

--- a/libs/hwui/platform/host/renderthread/RenderThread.cpp
+++ b/libs/hwui/platform/host/renderthread/RenderThread.cpp
@@ -15,6 +15,13 @@
  */
 
